Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9937893Z 
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9938478Z - The step budget wrapper (`scripts/run-with-budget-warning.sh`) no longer
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9939253Z   kills a command up to a second before its budget ends: bash's `SECONDS`
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9940002Z   counts second boundaries, so a 3s budget could expire after about 2s. This
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9940738Z   failed the JS unit tests on macOS and blocked the release of #334.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9941880Z - The changeset check counts only the changesets a pull request adds, so an
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9942631Z   unreleased changeset from an earlier pull request no longer satisfies it.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9943404Z - `agent generate` builds the agent configuration with `generateText` and
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9944476Z   `Output.object` instead of the deprecated `generateObject`, so it no longer
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9945247Z   prints an AI SDK `DeprecationWarning`. The AI SDK warning tests now capture
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9946028Z   warnings through `AI_SDK_LOG_WARNINGS`: AI SDK 7 reports them through
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9946731Z   `process.emitWarning`, which the old `console.warn` mock never saw.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9947535Z - The `allowScripts` entry for `node-pty` matches the locked 1.1.0 instead of
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9948190Z   1.2.0-beta.15, and `js/.npmrc` sets `strict-allow-scripts` so a stale entry
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9949613Z   fails the install instead of logging a warning. CI installs on Node 26,
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9950135Z   which `@opentui/core` requires.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9950631Z - Instant Release runs only after lint, the tests, the verbose integration
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9951467Z   test and the package install check pass, and every release job requires
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9951881Z   lint and test to succeed.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9952307Z - A release rerun recognises that an earlier attempt already pushed its
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9952845Z   version commit when main moved meanwhile, instead of skipping the publish.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9953427Z - The release pushes its version commit with up to three attempts, rebasing
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9953961Z   onto main when another merge landed first, instead of failing the release.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9954552Z - The pipeline status gate fails on every unsuccessful job result, including
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9955103Z   a test that `timeout-minutes` cancelled on a pull request. A cancellation
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9955610Z   passes only when a newer run replaced this one and the job's own
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9956335Z   `cancel-in-progress` allowed that. Set `PIPELINE_STATUS_VERBOSE=1` to trace
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9956852Z   each decision. Every workflow now ends in such a gate.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9957669Z - Model tests fail at once with the secret's name when `GROQ_API_KEY` is
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9958163Z   missing, and warn when Kilo models run without `KILO_API_KEY`.
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9958683Z - Refresh the AI SDK packages to their latest patch releases, which the
Check for Changesets	Check for changesets	2026-10-22T19:52:52.9959219Z   Dependency Freshness check requires, and update `ip-address` to 10.7.4 for
